<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon has received a Metal Shark patrol boat to strengthen maritime security, while government forces continue targeting Anglophone separatist groups in the Northwest and Southwest regions. An explosion at a steel plant in Cameroon killed four people and seriously injured sixteen. Anti-femicide protests have taken place in Cameroon, reflecting broader social tensions. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBGT1RjejE5QkpYMlJkRm01ZWVLeWlBbnNtdGVBRUFVSHM1NXdPSnBPaDBfOWdqdklIVnZyNTBsOHR0YzZZZHlJcEhPcy05a1N6UFJfcHM4b29zbndoM0HSAWNBVV95cUxPc3BzWlV6ZXZyZkNSbzAwSzRGTmtiNkRsUEtKVWhxNXhkaUZkRThMa2owUVU4eGVOMnNqamY1TFBaTWNCSUYxTzF0ZG1Tb1I2bFNOb01DMTByczVoMG13MFdhUDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE9Kc2prX2xvY3lUanR0SWZ2SGkyekJXM3NUZFR3akJJYUxkWkNPejYxWkdxQkZSMUR0a19Oa0U0Q1Y4eDdfb3VxQUNzQmxsUUVqNU81cTF6Z0hnOEtXZk9aeV8xVE1Xc1V3dDNTQTl3QTlrSlRYYmZscWdxNUlxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Erasing 76 Crimes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNSnRYNmZvUjVNUlM3N25odGZPbFBacnRmQ3ZKXzBLSURjSFdFMzBIdnU2ZUJSTDNjSHROOE8yTnAxemlRVjVzSzNzM3ZMcFVOd29BRXJoa2ZMWmFOcnMtOHZ0UGl4bHdCSmxaZmM0Q0Vfb25MN2FWNVRibFJqWlpka3NmdGRPVHVTcGpmSVlpY0xpbVpjWDBvUjQ0eEE5ZDVJSnFUNWc1Vlc4bWQ4ZXlmYVFWMFBROTdVSXVDZzJVaTc4dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ms. Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPX3pKYXNBQk9qQThlZ2hmbHhfS20tYlNOU0JEWnBtWEw0aUVjQlBHdEJZSlJRTmpWSS1GVXdQMXBMcjg4Y1piVlNOMmdpRmdDYVJMYjBBZEF5cDFYU3hWeVAwdDBxczYzWU1JUFVockwydXFCVU5oQnpmREY1N2FmbEJ5ZXc0ZDZBb1prNndodmFSM3U2QVcyb1RNZEo1TkNWVXB1Q1hYZ0huV0xRc1V6LU5FSUtObEs5dkhMUnJyS1U2N0hlZFVsMnZ5YjA?o